Weeks 1-4: the basic ideas and vocabulary of the course.
Weeks 5-8: practice, applications and the first project.
Weeks 9-12: review and the term exam.

Grades: activities 30%, quizzes 30%, task performance 40%. Passing grade: 70.
Attendance: more than 3 absences in a month is reported to the guidance counselor.' AS body, NULL AS link_url, 0 AS position, @u_prov AS created_by_user_id, (@day0 + INTERVAL -36 DAY + INTERVAL 0 HOUR + INTERVAL 0 MINUTE) AS created_at_utc, (@day0 + INTERVAL -36 DAY + INTERVAL 0 HOUR + INTERVAL 0 MINUTE) AS updated_at_utc
